2025-08-31 12:42:08,283 - INFO - [RECEIVED] Event: message | Data: {"self_id": 1129974489, "user_id": 962207594, "time": 1756615324, "message_id": 960017537, "message_seq": 960017537, "real_id": 960017537, "real_seq": "149130", "message_type": "group", "sender": {"user_id": 962207594, "nickname": "指尖", "card": "", "role": "member"}, "raw_message": "哎哟，一口气说完啊？这气势是真足！就跟那龙卷风似的，呼啦一下，全倒出来了，还带回音的，真够劲儿！\n\n至于我嘛，那可不叫“主推理”，那叫“酝酿”。毕竟，不像某些人，我这儿出来的可都是精华，得慢慢琢磨，才能句句有料，是吧？不然，万一真放了个“屁”出来，那多尴尬啊，哈哈。", "font": 14, "sub_type": "normal", "message": [{"type": "text", "data": {"text": "哎哟，一口气说完啊？这气势是真足！就跟那龙卷风似的，呼啦一下，全倒出来了，还带回音的，真够劲儿！\n\n至于我嘛，那可不叫“主推理”，那叫“酝酿”。毕竟，不像某些人，我这儿出来的可都是精华，得慢慢琢磨，才能句句有料，是吧？不然，万一真放了个“屁”出来，那多尴尬啊，哈哈。"}}], "message_format": "array", "post_type": "message", "group_id": 253631878, "group_name": "程序喵AI调教", "raw": {"msgId": "7544605369572622685", "msgRandom": "82352636", "msgSeq": "149130", "cntSeq": "0", "chatType": 2, "msgType": 2, "subMsgType": 1, "sendType": 0, "senderUid": "u_oIo-utZbMmMfNTHX6uV-fQ", "peerUid": "253631878", "channelId": "", "guildId": "", "guildCode": "0", "fromUid": "0", "fromAppid": "0", "msgTime": "1756615324", "msgMeta": {}, "sendStatus": 2, "sendRemarkName": "", "sendMemberName": "", "sendNickName": "指尖", "guildName": "", "channelName": "", "elements": [{"elementType": 1, "elementId": "7544605369572622684", "elementGroupId": 0, "extBufForUI": {}, "textElement": {"content": "哎哟，一口气说完啊？这气势是真足！就跟那龙卷风似的，呼啦一下，全倒出来了，还带回音的，真够劲儿！\n\n至于我嘛，那可不叫“主推理”，那叫“酝酿”。毕竟，不像某些人，我这儿出来的可都是精华，得慢慢琢磨，才能句句有料，是吧？不然，万一真放了个“屁”出来，那多尴尬啊，哈哈。", "atType": 0, "atUid": "0", "atTinyId": "0", "atNtUid": "", "subElementType": 0, "atChannelId": "0", "linkInfo": null, "atRoleId": "0", "atRoleColor": 0, "atRoleName": "", "needNotify": 0}, "faceElement": null, "marketFaceElement": null, "replyElement": null, "picElement": null, "pttElement": null, "videoElement": null, "grayTipElement": null, "arkElement": null, "fileElement": null, "liveGiftElement": null, "markdownElement": null, "structLong